      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Sounds like the same issue I have:\n\n- Open VRChat\n\n- Set a Wing (Quick Menu Right in my case) to Avatars\n\n- Set Filters > SHOW to anything other than Favourites 1\n\n- Restart VRChat\n\n- Avatar Wing will be set back to Favourites 1\n\nBuild 1830 Open Beta - Proton\n\nI did reinstall VRChat recently as well, which wiped the prefix (perhaps equivalent to Windows reinstall from vrc's perspective...)",
